1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,601
Then the curve flattens.

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:06,080
More light does nothing, because carbon dioxide is now limiting.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:11,679
Raise the carbon dioxide and the whole curve lifts to a new, higher plateau.

4
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:19,192
In the field, carbon dioxide, now about four hundred and twenty-seven parts per million, is usually the limiting factor.

